SOAPBOX: to hear the numbers on a CQ call (it sounds like a contest exchange) and the Skimmer spots confuse N1MM, leading to duplicate QSOs.
SOAPBOX: I know you mean well but it is counterproductive.  73 CU NXT YR, de Gary ZM4G, normally ZL2iFB.
